<p>There are no unused StringIDs available in your module's range.
</p>
<h3><span class="mw-headline" id="What_to_do.3F">What to do?</span></h3>
<p>You don't need to lose your work - you can change the module ID ranges from the File-&gt;Manage Modules-&gt;Properties dialog and then retry saving your file.
</p>
