</td>
<td> <div class="thumb tright"><div class="thumbinner" style="width:202px;"><a href="https://github.com/adarec1994/DragonAgeToolset/wiki/File%20-%20Module%20manage%20module%20window.png"><img alt="" src="https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adarec1994/DragonAgeToolset/main/Wiki/assets/mw/images/7/7c/Module_manage_module_window.png" width="200" height="249" class="thumbimage" srcset="https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adarec1994/DragonAgeToolset/main/Wiki/assets/mw/images/7/7c/Module_manage_module_window.png 1.5x, https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adarec1994/DragonAgeToolset/main/Wiki/assets/mw/images/7/7c/Module_manage_module_window.png 2x" /></a>  <div class="thumbcaption"><div class="magnify"><a href="https://github.com/adarec1994/DragonAgeToolset/wiki/File%20-%20Module%20manage%20module%20window.png" title="Enlarge"></a></div>Then click the "Properties" button to open module properties.</div></div></div>
